# ============================================================
# pitavastatin-ezetimibe-evidence — Cross-session Research repo
# ============================================================
# Rule: full-text PDFs and any parsed/OCR'd full text (LlamaParse
# output, scraped article bodies, etc.) are LOCAL-ONLY working
# material. They must never be committed unless a specific file's
# redistribution license has been verified and recorded in
# 02_SOURCE-INVENTORY.md (verified: true, license: <name>).
#
# Only commit: metadata, extraction tables, citation lists, and
# synthesis/markdown written by the research roles.

# --- Full-text / raw literature (local-only by default) ---
**/10_DATA/fulltext/
**/10_DATA/raw-pdf/
**/20_EVIDENCE/**/fulltext/
**/*.pdf
**/*.PDF
**/llamaparse-output/
**/*.parsed.md
**/*_parsed.md

# --- Secrets / credentials (must NEVER be tracked) ---
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
**/secrets/
**/*apikey*
**/*api_key*
**/*credentials*.json
mcp-config.local.json

# --- OS / editor noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.tmp
.claude/worktrees/

# --- Explicit local scratch space ---
/scratch/
/tmp/

# --- MCP tool local cache (added Wave 2, PI directive 2026-08-31) ---
# Local content-addressable cache written by MCP tooling (e.g. paper-search /
# llamaparse blob cache). Never durable research output — local-only, never committed.
.metadata_cache/
**/.metadata_cache/

# --- Inbox intake material (added RUN 2026-09-01-v1, 2026-09-01) ---
# Raw Google Drive intake and any "official" full-text drops under inbox/ are
# local-only working material, same rule as 10_DATA/fulltext/ above — every
# intake file is derivative/unverified secondary material (or, for full-text
# PDFs/derivatives, subject to the same licensing rule, CLAUDE.md §11) until a
# specialist has independently verified specific claims/redistribution rights
# and the Director has recorded that in 02_SOURCE-INVENTORY.md. Never commit
# raw inbox/ content directly — only the curated citations/extractions that
# result from verifying it.
inbox/
